### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (or copy into Postman)
@base = http://localhost:5000/api

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Register candidate
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test User", "email": "test@example.com", "password": "Password@123", "role": "candidate" }

### Login (copy token from response)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "candidate1@careerconnect.com", "password": "Password@123" }

### Wrong password -> 401
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "candidate1@careerconnect.com", "password": "wrong" }

### Public jobs with search/filter/pagination
GET {{base}}/jobs?search=react&location=bangalore&employmentType=Full-time&page=1&limit=5

### No token -> 401
GET {{base}}/applications

### Candidate creating a job -> 403
POST {{base}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_CANDIDATE_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Hack", "description": "Should be rejected", "location": "Pune", "companyName": "X" }

### Candidate hitting admin route -> 403
GET {{base}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_CANDIDATE_TOKEN

### Recruiter creates job (validation error -> 400: missing title)
POST {{base}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_RECRUITER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "A valid description here", "location": "Pune", "companyName": "TechNova" }

### Unknown job -> 404
GET {{base}}/jobs/64b000000000000000000000
